	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_stop_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ネジやま　まで　つながる
ちかみちを　ほりはじめたのさ▼
だけど　まだまだ　だね
なにせ　ほるのは　たいへんだから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:25:35" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:17:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山まで　つながる
近道を　掘り始めたのさ▼
だけど　まだまだ　だね
なにせ　掘るのは　大変だから</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:26:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:17:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・抜け道ストッパー
・会話時
※初回殿堂入りで削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-18T11:23:51" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:16:58" />
