・c05ジムストッパー</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-18T11:06:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN
←BUSINESSMAN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-21T09:39:04" />
