	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swplazmam_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだん『なあ！▼
まえみたいに　たのしく
ひとの　ポケモン　うばおうや！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T06:03:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:57:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団『なあ！▼
前みたいに　楽しく
人の　ポケモン　奪おうや！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T06:03:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:04:29" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・GRIDX＝219、GRIDZ＝431
・posでイベント発動
・GRIDX＝221、GRIDZ＝430～434
・続けてhakaim_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:33:14" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:48:43" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:49:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_hakaim_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『ダメだよ▼
ひとの　ものを　とったら　ドロボウ
だと　みにしみて　わかったからさ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T11:40:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T02:57:52" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『ダメだよ▼
ひとの　ものを　とったら　ドロボウ
だと　身にしみて　わかったからさ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-20T11:40:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
