			<Comment>♂
・続けてswplazmam_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:45:42" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKAIM
元プラズマ団♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:38:27" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05_swplazmam_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだん『Ｎ！▼
なにが　プラズマだんの　おうさまだ
ただの　うらぎりもの　だろ！▼
こまった　おれたちを　みすてて
どこかに　きえちまった　やつだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T06:07:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:42:09" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団『Ｎ！▼
なにが　プラズマ団の　王様だ
ただの　裏切り者　だろ！▼
こまった　おれたちを　見捨てて
どこかに　消えちまった　奴だ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-24T06:07:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:42:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswrival_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:45:36" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-19T05:41:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
