・続けてswrival_06</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T04:27:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER5
ジムリーダー・ヤーコン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T05:48:27" />
